{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36935","headline":"送蕲州裴员外 · 罗隐","name":"送蕲州裴员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六枝仙桂最先春，萧洒高辞九陌尘。\n两晋家声须有主，六朝文雅别无人。\n荣驱豹尾抛同辈，贵上螭头见近臣。\n蕲水苍生莫相羡，早看归去掌丝纶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}